00:02:07.960 --> 00:02:12.700
And breaking down what does
sustainability built in mean,

00:02:12.700 --> 00:02:16.360
it means from hardware, to
the offices that we build,

00:02:16.360 --> 00:02:18.340
to the data centers
that we build,

00:02:18.340 --> 00:02:20.890
we're going to
prioritize sustainability

00:02:20.890 --> 00:02:22.810
